      "t": "Approach & key decisions",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Ran a cost-effort analysis showing a CRM added complexity while an automated waitlist could fulfil seats directly. Aligned stakeholders on the data (fewer manual calls, ~90% faster turnaround), then wrote the stories and acceptance criteria, facilitated UAT, and coordinated release.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Results",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "60 of 200 waitlisted learners (30%) converted to enrolments and no seats went unfilled; CRM complexity avoided. Everyone aligned once the results landed.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Specific internal data is summarised at the level Newton School permits publicly; happy to discuss details in conversation.",
